WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:04.740
Best-selling author, Jack Spencer, finally 
released a new book today that

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.610
confirms his place in the one-hit wonder aisle.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.320
Daddy!

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.640
Do you guys have to leave?

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.960
We're just going on a grown-up vacation.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.240
We used to do it all the time.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.580
You guys are gonna love this place, trust me.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.280
Who are you?

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.020
Calm down.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.310
Nate must've double-booked us.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:32.100
Nate?

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.420
Hey, welcome to Green Acres.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:37.780
Would you like a tour of the land?

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.740
Yes.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:49.780
You should stay.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:51.340
We should go.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.300
You are not staying here for us.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.758
You're staying for Magic Mike.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.280
Hello, Theroux.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:58.520
Hello, Tarzan.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.240
We are supposed to be saving our marriage, 
but all you have done is be dude-downer.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:09.560
Stop!

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:10.420
Stop it!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Hey!

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.400
This is a violent free zone den!

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:12.960
Jack!

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.940
Amanda!

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:22.160
You guys look totally made for glamping.

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.240
Glamping?

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.940
Is that like a thing?

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:25.920
Totally!

00:01:25.925 --> 00:01:27.560
We keep doing that!

